# Format: case_bam,control_bam  (one pair per line, no header row)
# Column 1: case (tumour) BAM filename
# Column 2: control (normal) BAM filename
# Filenames are relative to the working directory.
# The pipeline strips BAM_SUFFIX (_final.bam) to derive sample names.
case01_final.bam,control01_final.bam
case02_final.bam,control02_final.bam
